   "source": [
    "# Questão 4\n",
    "\n",
    "Implemente a função:\n",
    "\n",
    "- `run_pipeline(model_type=\"rf\", seed=42)`\n",
    "\n",
    "Ela deve:\n",
    "- Carregar os dados\n",
    "- Treinar o modelo escolhido (`rf` ou `ab`)\n",
    "- Avaliar o modelo\n",
    "- Retornar a acurácia"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "lcGEK8nA67BP"
   },
   "source": [
    "**Solução**:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "0PG_PNLL5SpM"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def run_pipeline(model_type=\"rf\", seed=42):\n",
    "    X_train, X_test, y_train, y_test = load_data(seed)\n",
    "\n",
    "    if model_type == \"rf\":\n",
    "        model = train_random_forest(X_train, y_train, seed)\n",
    "    elif model_type == \"ab\":\n",
    "        model = train_adaboost(X_train, y_train, seed)\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        raise ValueError(\"model_type deve ser 'rf' ou 'ab'\")\n",
    "\n",
    "    acc = evaluate(model, X_test, y_test)\n",
    "    return acc\n"
   ]
  },
